  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2006-12-10T17:05:03-06:00",
   "body": "The Grizzled Den is slightly Southeast of Kharanos, for those who don't have coordinates.  Wendigos can be quite bothersome at this level, so I recommend you take one or two friends along with you.  The Wendigos don't drop these frequently, but don't give up!  It generally takes players 2 clears of the cave to get all of the manes.",
